Create a professional, mobile-friendly Artikaz Driver Directory application based on the attached screenshot. The app should look as close as possible to the screenshot and work smoothly on Android phones.

1. App Design

- App title: ARTIKAZ • FLEET OPERATIONS
- Main heading: Driver Directory
- Subtitle: “Search driver records and copy Iqama, mobile, or plate details in one tap.”
- Use a modern dark theme with a black background, dark navy header, dark grey cards, white text, and blue buttons.
- Use rounded corners, clear fonts, proper spacing, and responsive mobile layouts.
- Design the interface to fit Android phone screens.

2. Main Screen

At the top, include:

1. A search bar with placeholder: “Search name, Iqama, phone, plate, company...”
2. A large blue + Add driver button.
3. A three-dot menu for additional options.
4. Three statistic cards:
   - Total records
   - Companies
   - Incomplete records

Below the statistics, add three navigation tabs:

- Driver directory
- Paste full driver list
- Add / edit record

3. Driver Directory

- Initially hide all driver records.
- Show driver details only when the user searches for a name, Iqama number, mobile number, vehicle plate, or company.
- Display matching results in a Drivers card.
- Show the number of matching results.
- When a driver is selected, display their information in the Driver details card.
- Include an Edit button.
- Show a helpful message when no driver is selected or no results are found.

4. Add and Edit Drivers

Create a form with these fields:

- Driver Name
- Iqama Number
- Mobile Number
- Vehicle Plate Number
- Company
- Remarks

Provide Save, Update, Cancel, and Delete options. Allow users to edit existing records without creating duplicates.

Do not include a Category field.

5. Offline Database

- Save driver records directly on the Android device.
- Use IndexedDB or another reliable local database.
- The app must work without an internet connection.
- Keep records saved after closing or reopening the app.
- Do not use temporary data that disappears after refreshing the page.
- Add confirmation before deleting any record.

6. Copy Details

Provide a copy button next to important fields:

- Driver name
- Iqama number
- Mobile number
- Vehicle plate number

Allow copying individual values and the complete driver record.

7. Import and Export

- Import a full driver list by pasting text.
- Parse driver information into the correct fields.
- Validate imported records and warn about duplicates.
- Export all records to CSV.
- Provide a backup and restore option.

8. Additional Features

- Search instantly as the user types.
- Support Arabic and English names.
- Display incomplete-record counts accurately.
- Show success and error messages.
- Include a Reset Search button.
- Add a menu for Import, Export, Backup, Restore, and Settings.
- Include a confirmation before resetting or deleting data.

9. Technical Requirements

Build the application using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Deliver a complete, working application, not just a design or screenshot.

Provide:

1. A single downloadable HTML file.
2. Offline functionality and persistent local storage.
3. An installable Android home-screen shortcut through PWA support.
4. Instructions for converting the app into an Android APK.
5. A clean, maintainable code structure.

