<p dir="auto" class="my-3 leading-[25px]"><strong>Kyun zaroori hai:</strong> Android APK banane ke liye normally Android Studio, coding aur Android SDK jaisi bhaari cheezein chahiye hoti hain. PWABuilder ye saara kaam apne aap kar deta hai, koi coding nahi karni padti. Aap ka app PWA hona chahiye (jo humara hai — manifest aur service worker ke saath bana hai), bas.</p>
