<ul dir="auto" class="my-2 ps-5 list-disc">
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">Repository page par <strong>"uploading an existing file"</strong> link par click karein.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">Apne phone/computer se <code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">artikaz-driver-directory.html</code> aur <code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">sw.js</code> dono files select karke upload karein.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]"><strong>Commit changes</strong> par click karein.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]"><strong>Important:</strong> <code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">artikaz-driver-directory.html</code> ka naam badal kar <strong><code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">index.html</code></strong> karna hoga. Repository me file par click karein → pencil (edit) icon → file ka naam <code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">index.html</code> karein → Commit.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">
<p dir="auto" class="my-3 leading-[25px]"><strong>Pages on karein:</strong></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="my-2 ps-5 list-disc">
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">Repository me <strong>Settings</strong> tab kholein.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">Left side me <strong>Pages</strong> par jayein.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">"Branch" me <strong>main</strong> select karein → <strong>Save</strong>.</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">1-2 minute wait karein — page refresh karke upar link milega, kuch aisa: <code class="bg-superagent-bg-code-inline text-superagent-text-code-inline border border-superagent-border-code-inline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" node="[object Object]">https://aapka-username.github.io/artikaz/</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">
<p dir="auto" class="my-3 leading-[25px]"><strong>Ho gaya!</strong> Wo link kholke check karein — app chalega. Yahi link:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="my-2 ps-5 list-disc">
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]">Phone par "Add to Home screen" ke liye, aur</li>
<li dir="auto" class="my-1 leading-[25px]"><strong><a href="https://pwabuilder.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400 dark:hover:text-orange-300 underline">pwabuilder.com</a></strong> par APK banane ke liye paste karna hai.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
